      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MABEL MONELLI (3) goes very well over this track and trip including five wins. Comes off a (22.43) win last time, scoring by 6 lengths in a Grade 6 over 400m at this track. Looks a key chance on best form. SUNSET VANADIUM (2) has been out of the placings at his last two outings but shapes well for this if he can recapture his head turning win a few runs back, getting around this track over 300m in 17.00. Should be in this for a long way. GO BOY (1) collided with another runner and finished in the minors of a Grade 5 last time (22.90) at this track over 400m. Must include in calculations. SUNSET CLAUDIUS (4) was out of the frame here most recently but can atone.",
